  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoon butter (for frying)",
    "24 ounce boneless, skinless chicken breast (sliced)",
    "1 ounce sun-dried tomatoes (chopped)",
    "8 ounce cherry tomatoes (diced)",
    "3 teaspoon fresh garlic (chopped)",
    "1 1/2 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "4 ounce parmesan cheese (shredded)",
    "4 ounce baby spinach",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "3 tablespoon butter (for frying)",
    "16 ounce green cabbage (shredded)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-parmesan-with-cabbage-pasta/#wprm-recipe-53685-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Chicken-Parm-with-Cabbage-Pasta-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "On medium to high heat, melt the butter in a pan and fry the chicken slices until cooked. Season to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-parmesan-with-cabbage-pasta/#wprm-recipe-53685-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Chicken-Parm-with-Cabbage-Pasta-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the sun-dried tomatoes, cherry tomatoes, and garlic to the pan and stir until well combined. Sautee for 1-2 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-parmesan-with-cabbage-pasta/#wprm-recipe-53685-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Chicken-Parm-with-Cabbage-Pasta-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the heavy cream and let it simmer for 4-6 minutes, or until it has thickened some.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-parmesan-with-cabbage-pasta/#wprm-recipe-53685-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Chicken-Parm-with-Cabbage-Pasta-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the shredded parmesan cheese, stir together, and let simmer for another 10 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-parmesan-with-cabbage-pasta/#wprm-recipe-53685-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Chicken-Parm-with-Cabbage-Pasta-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the spinach to the pan and stir well. Once the spinach starts to wilt, remove pan from heat and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-parmesan-with-cabbage-pasta/#wprm-recipe-53685-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Chicken-Parm-with-Cabbage-Pasta-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate pan, melt the butter and add the cabbage to the pan. Season with salt and pepper, then cook until just soft.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-parmesan-with-cabbage-pasta/#wprm-recipe-53685-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Chicken-Parm-with-Cabbage-Pasta-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plate the cabbage and top with the chicken parmesan. Add salt and pepper if desired. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-parmesan-with-cabbage-pasta/#wprm-recipe-53685-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
